% Ground abstraction of gk_claude.js for the reference tool, written by hand from the
% extracted clauses. The tool declines the extraction, which has Skolem functions.
% c = isa(certified, Mara) at .7746 and its negation at .7746; person comes from both
% sentences; acc and use are the two defaults at .95; q stands for the question atom $defq0.
0.7746::c.
0.7746::-c.
0.7746::person.
0.7746::person.
0.95::acc :- person, c, unless(-acc, 1).
0.95::use :- person, acc, unless(-use, 1).
q :- use.
use :- q.
query(q).
